    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 99c3072c6fd4db7fd007b440f6923300691b2597 -->\nReview of PR #253 (head 99c3072), independent of the author.\n\nClean.\n\n- The diff adds exactly one line, `coolant: Default::default(),`, in two files: `crates/app/tests/drilling_cross_holder.rs` (`fn op()`) and `crates/app/tests/drilling_cross_part.rs` (`fn op(cross)`). Both are inside the `Operation { ... }` literal, after `area`, at the field indentation (8 spaces), with no other changes.\n- Scanned every struct literal `Operation { ... }` in `crates/*/tests/*.rs` on origin/fix/main-test-build (228 test files). Every literal that does not already set `coolant` is a functional-update literal (`..op.clone()`, `..op(tool, ...)`) that inherits it, or a `CommandKind::CreateOperation { ... }` variant, which is a different type. No remaining E0063 site found.\n- Not built here: the change is a one-field addition in test code, and the grep check covers the build break.\n",
